The files below derive from that work and have been modified (new helpers
added, others changed or removed); the original copyright and SPDX headers are
retained in each file:

  templates/_affinities.tpl     templates/_resources.tpl
  templates/_capabilities.tpl   templates/_secrets.tpl
  templates/_errors.tpl         templates/_storage.tpl
  templates/_images.tpl         templates/_tplvalues.tpl
  templates/_ingress.tpl        templates/_utils.tpl
  templates/_labels.tpl         templates/_warnings.tpl
  templates/_names.tpl

The remaining templates (_annotations, _containers, _environment,
_serviceaccount, _spread, _volume) were written for this repository.
